00:36:44.536 --> 00:36:48.040
Okay, so papasok na tayo sa vent
sa eksaktong 30 minuto.

637
00:36:49.207 --> 00:36:51.627
[Gye-young] <i>Okay.
Paggawa sa pagpapalawak ng pasukan.</i>

638
00:36:54.338 --> 00:36:56.340
[kumakabog]

639
00:37:01.845 --> 00:37:03.846
[Arron] Whoa, whoa, there. [bumuntong hininga]

640
00:37:03.847 --> 00:37:06.349
[nakanguso]

641
00:37:06.350 --> 00:37:08.435
Uh... Excuse me.

642
00:37:09.645 --> 00:37:11.396
Oh, oh, oh.

643
00:37:28.455 --> 00:37:30.331
Mrs Kim nahihiya ka.

644
00:37:30.332 --> 00:37:33.126
Ilang beses na kitang tinanong
hindi uminom sa trabaho, ha?

645
00:37:38.048 --> 00:37:39.049
[bumuntong hininga]

646
00:37:40.175 --> 00:37:42.803
Tatlong nakatagong bote. Jeez, ginang.
[nagpapalinis ng lalamunan]

647
00:37:47.140 --> 00:37:48.141
[lumagok]

648
00:37:53.063 --> 00:37:53.897
Ah!

649
00:38:15.377 --> 00:38:17.712
[Gye-young] <i>Meron lang kami
upang sundin ang mga lagusan, tama?</i>

650
00:38:17.713 --> 00:38:19.588
<i>Paano natin malalaman kung aling daan ang pupuntahan?</i>

651
00:38:19.589 --> 00:38:22.217
[Jae-yoon] <i>Arron Park
ay gagabay sa amin sa pamamagitan ng mga lagusan.</i>

652
00:38:23.176 --> 00:38:25.469
<i>Siya ang nangasiwa
ang pagbuo ng sistema ng bentilasyon</i>

653
00:38:25.470 --> 00:38:27.096
<i>at alam ng puso ang layout.</i>

654
00:38:27.097 --> 00:38:31.142
<i>Mamarkahan niya ang mga arrow upang ipakita ang tamang landas
dapat nating gawin upang maabot ang pangunahing lagusan.</i>

655
00:38:31.143 --> 00:38:33.770
<i>Ang lahat ng aming koponan ay kailangang gawin
ay sundin ang mga arrow.</i>

656
00:38:39.026 --> 00:38:39.943
Yun ang plano.

657
00:38:40.485 --> 00:38:42.029
Dapat tayong maging mabilis at tahimik.

658
00:38:45.741 --> 00:38:48.409
Sergeant Kim Young-man,
Corporal Kwak Gye-young,

659
00:38:48.410 --> 00:38:49.578
naghihintay ng iyong mga order.

660
00:38:50.370 --> 00:38:52.121
Oo. Nakaayos na kaming lahat dito.

661
00:38:52.122 --> 00:38:54.373
Corporal Kwak Gye-young.
Handa na kaming umalis.

662
00:38:54.374 --> 00:38:56.083
Good luck sa lahat.

663
00:38:56.084 --> 00:38:57.669
See you all on the other side!

664
00:38:59.504 --> 00:39:00.671
Paano iyon?

665
00:39:00.672 --> 00:39:03.382
Oo. Tama si Gye-young, kayo.

666
00:39:03.383 --> 00:39:04.926
Lahat, gawin itong buhay.

667
00:39:05.469 --> 00:39:06.386
utos yan.

668
00:39:07.304 --> 00:39:09.388
Direkta mula sa iyong squad commander.

669
00:39:09.389 --> 00:39:12.017
<i>- Oo, ginoo!
- Sir, oo, sir.</i>

670
00:39:12.809 --> 00:39:14.810
- Mga piping asno.
- Lahat ng miyembro ng squad,

671
00:39:14.811 --> 00:39:17.022
malinaw na ngayon upang simulan ang kanilang ruta ng pagtakas.

672
00:39:22.152 --> 00:39:24.362
[In-ho ungol]

673
00:39:26.448 --> 00:39:28.450
Paolo, hawakan mo ang kamay ko. Sunggaban mo.

674
00:39:38.335 --> 00:39:39.544
[Soo-jeong] Mag-ingat ka.

675
00:39:40.253 --> 00:39:42.672
Nag-aalala ka ba sa akin?

676
00:39:43.590 --> 00:39:45.175
[Soo-jeong] Tumahimik ka at umakyat!

677
00:39:46.676 --> 00:39:48.678
[ungol]

678
00:39:51.723 --> 00:39:53.809
Hoy, nakikita mo ang mga arrow?

679
00:39:55.393 --> 00:39:56.311
Fucking hell.

680
00:39:58.188 --> 00:40:00.565
Kyung-sik! Hintayin mo ako.

681
00:40:03.819 --> 00:40:06.070
Ah, shit. [pantalon]

682
00:40:06.071 --> 00:40:08.448
[ubo]

683
00:40:13.912 --> 00:40:16.122
[Jae-yoon] Lumiko sa kaliwa. Lumiko sa kaliwa.

684
00:40:16.123 --> 00:40:18.208
[hinihingal]

685
00:40:30.387 --> 00:40:31.388
Gawin natin ito.

686
00:40:34.975 --> 00:40:36.977
[umiikot]

687
00:40:39.563 --> 00:40:40.564
Okay.

688
00:40:47.487 --> 00:40:49.489
[nakanguso]

689
00:41:00.292 --> 00:41:02.294
[umiikot]

690
00:41:09.467 --> 00:41:11.469
[sumisigaw]

691
00:41:26.318 --> 00:41:28.320
[sumisigaw]

692
00:41:43.460 --> 00:41:44.294
Shit!

693
00:41:46.213 --> 00:41:47.379
[nakanguso]

694
00:41:47.380 --> 00:41:48.298
[sigaw]

695
00:41:57.766 --> 00:41:59.768
[hinihingal]

696
00:42:03.521 --> 00:42:04.356
Maghintay ka.

697
00:42:05.148 --> 00:42:06.358
Ang lahat ng mga arrow ay nawala.

698
00:42:08.401 --> 00:42:09.402
[Arron] Anong meron?

699
00:42:10.278 --> 00:42:12.821
[laughs] Ginawa mo talaga.

700
00:42:12.822 --> 00:42:14.032
Okay ka lang, Paolo?

701
00:42:15.158 --> 00:42:16.076
Hindi.

702
00:42:17.118 --> 00:42:19.453
Okay lang ako, Arron.
Ituloy lang natin, okay?

703
00:42:19.454 --> 00:42:20.746
God, naiinitan ako.

704
00:42:20.747 --> 00:42:23.291
Hay, ang layo kaya natin?

705
00:42:24.334 --> 00:42:25.709
Malapit na.

706
00:42:25.710 --> 00:42:28.046
Limang minuto pa tayo,
kaya tara na, tara na.

707
00:42:28.713 --> 00:42:30.340
Okay, tara na.

708
00:42:31.549 --> 00:42:33.551
[ungol, humihingal]

709
00:42:36.471 --> 00:42:38.014
[Jae-yoon] Go, go, go. Go, go.

710
00:42:45.563 --> 00:42:48.441
Nasaan ang mga arrow?

711
00:42:49.401 --> 00:42:51.736
[mga pilit]

712
00:42:53.613 --> 00:42:55.990
Hoy, teka. Soo-jeong. Soo-jeong.

713
00:42:55.991 --> 00:42:57.866
- Huh?
- Ikaw, um...

714
00:42:57.867 --> 00:42:59.868
Pinapapagod mo ang iyong katawan.

715
00:42:59.869 --> 00:43:02.371
Mas mabilis kang mapagod
at hindi masyadong aasenso.

716
00:43:02.372 --> 00:43:04.123
Ang kailangan mong gawin ay i-relax ang iyong katawan

717
00:43:04.124 --> 00:43:06.125
at gamitin ang iyong magkabilang bisig

718
00:43:06.126 --> 00:43:08.961
para itulak at unti-unti kang sumulong.

719
00:43:08.962 --> 00:43:10.422
[grunts] Ganito.

720
00:43:11.298 --> 00:43:12.132
Oh.

721
00:43:13.300 --> 00:43:15.635
ganito? Oh!

722
00:43:16.219 --> 00:43:17.554
Ito ay paraan mas madali tulad nito.

723
00:43:19.806 --> 00:43:20.807
tama?

724
00:43:21.391 --> 00:43:23.393
ganito. ganito.

725
00:43:24.602 --> 00:43:25.769
ganito.

726
00:43:25.770 --> 00:43:27.313
Wala akong masyadong talento,

727
00:43:27.314 --> 00:43:29.732
pero nanalo ako sa unang pwesto sa boot camp
para sa paggapang.

728
00:43:29.733 --> 00:43:31.400
[Soo-jeong] Hesukristo. [tumawa]

729
00:43:31.401 --> 00:43:33.569
[Gye-young] Hindi ganoon.
I-relax ang iyong lower body.

730
00:43:33.570 --> 00:43:35.238
- Ganito?
- [Gye-young] Ganito.

731
00:43:38.283 --> 00:43:39.908
[Soo-jeong] Anong ginagawa mo?

732
00:43:39.909 --> 00:43:41.827
Tingnan ang paatras na pag-crawl.

733
00:43:41.828 --> 00:43:44.163
Ito ay nasa iyong likod. ganito.

734
00:43:44.164 --> 00:43:45.832
- Huh?
- [nakanguso]

735
00:43:49.586 --> 00:43:51.588
[sumisigaw]

736
00:44:03.058 --> 00:44:03.892
[ungol]

737
00:44:10.732 --> 00:44:11.607
[nakanguso]

738
00:44:11.608 --> 00:44:13.567
[Soo-jeong] Gye-young, pagsamahin mo ito.

739
00:44:13.568 --> 00:44:15.737
Kailangan pa nating mag-date! [bumuntong hininga]

740
00:44:16.780 --> 00:44:18.822
- Halika! Halika na!
- Doon! sa ganoong paraan!

741
00:44:18.823 --> 00:44:20.157
[sigaw]

742
00:44:20.158 --> 00:44:23.328
[ungol]

743
00:44:28.124 --> 00:44:30.251
[nakanguso]

744
00:44:33.630 --> 00:44:36.382
Soo-jeong, konti na lang.
Ituloy mo lang.

745
00:44:36.383 --> 00:44:38.385
[ungol]

746
00:44:47.936 --> 00:44:49.938
[sumisigaw]

747
00:44:51.439 --> 00:44:53.441
[nakanguso]

748
00:45:03.201 --> 00:45:05.203
[sumisigaw]

749
00:45:14.254 --> 00:45:16.256
[sumisigaw]

750
00:45:16.965 --> 00:45:18.299
Diyos ko!

751
00:45:19.759 --> 00:45:20.593
[sigaw]

752
00:45:22.595 --> 00:45:24.597
[nagpapatugtog ng musika]

